{"text":"kuruntokai","n":307,"lines":["வளையுடைத் தனைய தாகிப் பலர்தொழச்","செவ்வாய் வானத் தையெனத் தோன்றி","இன்னம் பிறந்தன்று பிறையே அன்னோ","மறந்தனர் கொல்லோ தாமே களிறுதன்","உயங்குநடை மடப்பிடி வருத்த நோனாது","நிலையுயர் யாஅந் தொலையக் குத்தி","வெண்ணார் கொண்டு கைசுவைத் தண்ணாந்","தழுங்க னெஞ்சமொடு முழங்கும்","அத்த நீளிடை அழப்பிரிந் தோரே"],"tr":["vaḷaiyuṭait taṉaiya tākip palartoḻac","cevvāy vāṉat taiyeṉat tōṉṟi","iṉṉam piṟantaṉṟu piṟaiyē aṉṉō","maṟantaṉar kollō tāmē kaḷiṟutaṉ","uyaṅkunaṭai maṭappiṭi varutta nōṉātu","nilaiyuyar yāan tolaiyak kutti","veṇṇār koṇṭu kaicuvait taṇṇān","taḻuṅka ṉeñcamoṭu muḻaṅkum","atta nīḷiṭai aḻappirin tōrē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"கடம்பனூர்ச் சாண்டிலியனார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Kaṭampaṉūrc Cāṇṭiliyaṉār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"9 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"8×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 31, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 18, veṇṭaḷai 12, kalittaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வளையுடைத்","tr":"vaḷaiyuṭait","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"வளை","tr":"vaḷai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யுடைத்","tr":"yuṭait"}]},{"text":"தனைய","tr":"taṉaiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தனை","tr":"taṉai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"தாகிப்","tr":"tākip","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தா","tr":"tā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கிப்","tr":"kip"}]},{"text":"பலர்தொழச்","tr":"palartoḻac","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பலர்","tr":"palar"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொழச்","tr":"toḻac"}]}],[{"text":"செவ்வாய்","tr":"cevvāy","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"செவ்","tr":"cev"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்","tr":"vāy"}]},{"text":"வானத்","tr":"vāṉat","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"